# Retro Template

Filename pattern:

```text
YYYY-MM-DD-<feature-or-change>-<session-slug>-retro.md
```

`<session-slug>` is your session's branch/worktree name (e.g. `charming-hoover-c0a3c9`) — appending it keeps the filename unique under parallel sessions (see `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_WORKFLOW.md` §3.2).

